  m_text: "CREDITS\r\n\nForbes Painter - Founder, 2D Artist\r\nAngelina Bologna -
    Game Engineer\r\nDialma Quiroz - Game Marketer & Artist\r\nHayes Geldmacher -
    Technical Designer, Rigging Artist, Audio Artist\r\nJace Kaushansky - Narrative
    Writing\r\nRaynard Christian - Game Engineer\r\nRen Barklow - 3D Character Artist
    & Animator\r\nTristan Moh - Producer\r\nXiangyu Liu Ryan - Environment Artist\r\nXuanhao
    Mei - VFX Artist\nJake Carlson - 2D Artist\nJosh Carlson - 3D Artist\r\n\r\n\r\nAUDIO
